/**
 * Real-browser check of the name filter, driven by Playwright through Drama
 * Finder. Named {@code *IT} so that plain {@code mvn test} stays browserless;
 * run it explicitly with
 * {@code mvn -o test -Dtest=CustomerListViewBrowserIT -Dheadless=true}.
